{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/124239-constrained-by-skills-with-regards-to-embeds-exploits","id":124239,"title":"Constrained by Skills with regards to Embeds/Exploits?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-02T20:10:39-07:00","id":124239,"title":"Constrained by Skills with regards to Embeds/Exploits?","content":"Random question, really. I think it makes perfect sense that they rely on skills, but I'm just wondering, do you guys allow your skill dots to dictate which Embeds you buy at all? Do you buy ones for skills you don't have dots in?<br /> <br /> I assume Untrained doesn't apply to Embeds/Exploits, right?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T20:31:23-07:00","id":124248,"title":"","content":"One the one hand, yes it does apply, on the other hand....Demons are kind of the undisputed masters of getting skills they don't have.<br /> <br /> Seriously, go through the Embed list and find out how many of them allow you take skills, in one form or fashion, and re-apply them, either from others or yourself, to different scenarios.<br /> <br /> I imagine Embeds demand personal knowledge though, so...Well, my approach has always been to go around both directions-who do I think this character is and what powers do I think are cool, and kind of find a way to marry the two. So, ultimately, yeah, a little bit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T20:34:09-07:00","id":124250,"title":"","content":"Would you allow say, Fungible Knowledge or Download Knowledge to apply to an Embed/Exploit roll?<br /> <br /> That's the approach I've been trying to take. It occasionally stinks when I see an Embed I like that I have NO dots in the skill for, I try to get at least one or two before I go there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T21:35:10-07:00","id":124277,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leetsepeak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/124239-constrained-by-skills-with-regards-to-embeds-exploits?p=124250#post124250\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would you allow say, Fungible Knowledge or Download Knowledge to apply to an Embed/Exploit roll?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> That's the approach I've been trying to take. It occasionally stinks when I see an Embed I like that I have NO dots in the skill for, I try to get at least one or two before I go there. </div> </div> </div>There is the admittedly cheesed approach of just condensing the list down to which Finesse Attribute has more of the things you're after and making sure to start with four dots in that one - no unskilled penalty, remember.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-03T06:48:57-07:00","id":124456,"title":"","content":"I confess in that my Demon concept is going to rely heavily on Dowbload Knowledge for some Embeds he doesn't have many/any skill dots for. On the one hand, it could be seen as very Jack of all trades. On the other, the random number of skill dots means it will be a variable numbers each time he uses it, rather than always being good at every Embed he has.<br /> <br /> I predict Download Knowledge will be a very popular Embed for this very reason, not just for the use of other Embeds, but being able to adapt to whatever scenario faces the Demon as well. Plus, given the heavy Matrix themes in the game, I can also see that aspect inspiring such a decision for most players.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1353-riche","name":"RichE","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-03T06:51:49-07:00","id":124458,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/124239-constrained-by-skills-with-regards-to-embeds-exploits?p=124277#post124277\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yep.<br /> <br /> <br /> There is the admittedly cheesed approach of just condensing the list down to which Finesse Attribute has more of the things you're after and making sure to start with four dots in that one - no unskilled penalty, remember.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/124239-constrained-by-skills-with-regards-to-embeds-exploits?p=124277#post124277\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yep.<br /> <br /> <br /> There is the admittedly cheesed approach of just condensing the list down to which Finesse Attribute has more of the things you're after and making sure to start with four dots in that one - no unskilled penalty, remember.</div> </div> </div> </div>Embeds don't suffer from unskilled penalties? Do you have a page number for reference?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1353-riche","name":"RichE","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-03T07:34:12-07:00","id":124478,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RichE</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/124239-constrained-by-skills-with-regards-to-embeds-exploits?p=124458#post124458\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Embeds don't suffer from unskilled penalties? Do you have a page number for reference?</div> </div> </div> </div>Design Principles sidebar on page 124. Third bullet point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-03T07:58:04-07:00","id":124499,"title":"","content":"Don't forget Legend! Your cover can give you missing skills, too!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-03T14:36:24-07:00","id":124774,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RichE</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/124239-constrained-by-skills-with-regards-to-embeds-exploits?p=124456#post124456\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I confess in that my Demon concept is going to rely heavily on Dowbload Knowledge for some Embeds he doesn't have many/any skill dots for. On the one hand, it could be seen as very Jack of all trades. On the other, the random number of skill dots means it will be a variable numbers each time he uses it, rather than always being good at every Embed he has. I predict Download Knowledge will be a very popular Embed for this very reason, not just for the use of other Embeds, but being able to adapt to whatever scenario faces the Demon as well. Plus, given the heavy Matrix themes in the game, I can also see that aspect inspiring such a decision for most players.</div> </div> </div> </div> i actually like the concept. its a bit of a gamble every time, but allows him adaptability at certain risk.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-04T07:33:24-07:00","id":125160,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/124239-constrained-by-skills-with-regards-to-embeds-exploits?p=124478#post124478\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Design Principles sidebar on page 124. Third bullet point.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, excellent, thanks man.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1353-riche","name":"RichE","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}